# Links to videos, playlists or even search lines like 'ytsearch1:Alien Ant Farm Smooth Criminal official video' go below
#
# Copy this file to links.txt (which git ignores), then run:
#   chvideo batch links.txt --library '/path/to/Songs'
#
# One entry per line. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
#   https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VIDEO_ID                  a video, matched to a song automatically
#   https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLAYLIST_ID         every video in a playlist
#   ytsearch1:Artist Song official video                      the first YouTube search result
#   /path/to/video.mp4                                        a local video file
#   https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VIDEO_ID | Song Folder    pin a video to a specific song folder
#
# See docs/usage.md for details.

